@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #205678
  FontColor #173247
  ArrowColor #205678
}
title Julia path cursor: captured graph and bounded results

state "Live source" as Source #D9F1FF
state "Complete captured graph" as Graph #E6F6E7
state "Open cursor with graph retain" as Open #D9F1FF
state "Pending slice" as Pending #FFF0C5
state "Owned path yielded" as Yielded #E6F6E7
state "Exact exhaustion" as Exhausted #E8EDF3
state "Explicit limit or error" as Failure #FBDCDC
state "Closed cursor" as Closed #E8EDF3

[*] --> Source : create WFST
Source --> Graph : bounded complete capture
Graph --> Open : ranked / pruned / sampled cursor
Open --> Open : source and caller graph handles may close
Open --> Pending : poll uses at most one slice
Pending --> Open : resume polling
Open --> Yielded : publish one complete owned path
Yielded --> Open : request another path
Open --> Exhausted : all ranked paths or exact window consumed
Open --> Failure : cap, work limit, cancellation, numeric error
Open --> Closed : early close or reducer exit
Exhausted --> Closed : release graph retain
Failure --> Closed : release graph retain
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
